{
  "harness": 1,
  "name": "k3-text",
  "about": "LumaScript text in a mod built by lumalink build: literals (static blocks), interpolation, == and byte order, len, starts_with, ends_with, find, slice and hash32 on UTF-8, a text pattern, structs, options, enums and tuples holding text compared part by part, a module value and functions giving text; the game's const char * read as a copy (a result, NameObj's field) and passed as a kept copy; a text kept past its loop round keeps its bytes while 299 other rounds' blocks are given back and reused",
